Badia Chipotle Ground
&#xD;
Chipotle is a variety of Jalapeno that is smoked using a method that dates back to the time of the Aztecs. This process gives the chipotle a delicious taste and aroma. It is widely used in the Mexican and international cuisine.

Badia Rosemary
